{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313880/extras/Crupt-_The_Colosseum_animated_logo_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1688085846\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight! Choose! Fight! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to The Colosseum! </h2><br>Crupt: The Colosseum flips the gameplay of Crupt on its head by thrusting you into a roguelite-style arena complete with Prizes, Modifiers, and plenty of enemies. Choose carefully, and you just might survive the next Round.<br><br><strong>(Note: The Colosseum is only unlocked after beating Crupt normally, so do that first!)</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313880/extras/colosseum_running_away_video_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1688085846\" /><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A new run every time<br></li><li>Rounds that increase in difficulty as you progress<br></li><li>Lots of choices for you to optimize your chances<br></li><li>100 obtainable Modifiers that can greatly alter your run<br></li><li>A bunch of new achievements (many of which unlock new Modifiers)<br></li><li>Minibosses to fight every 5 Rounds<br></li><li>A new wacky character to talk to<br></li><li>12 new original music tracks<br></li><li>Pobs?<br></li><li>Teleporters of the explosive variety<br></li><li>Teleporters of the non-explosive variety</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313880/extras/compulsion_video__perfect_loop__AdobeExpress__1_.gif?t=1688085846\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2313880?t=1688085846","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1688085846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1688085846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steams